<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Oh, don’t let this wisdom depart from your sight.</l><l>Tis Life for your soul—this knowledge so bright</l><l>Your feet will not stumble as you walk down the street;</l><l>You won’t be afraid and your sleep will be sweet.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Ha-la-la-la-la-la-la-la-le-lu-jah!</l><l>Ha-la-la-la-la-la-la-la-le-lu-jah!</l><l>Ha-la-la-la-la-la-la-la-le-lu-jah!</l><l>Ha-la-la-la-la-la-la-la-le-lu-jah!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
